  "title": "MySQL: Decode JSON in binary resultset",
  "description": "When using MySQL with prepared statements then JSON results were not decoded.\n\nCode:\n```python\n#!/bin/python3\nfrom datetime import datetime\nimport mysql.connector\n\nc = mysql.connector.connect(\n    host='127.0.0.1',\n    user='root',\n    database='test',\n    ssl_disabled=True\n)\n\ncur = c.cursor(prepared=True)\n\ncur.execute('SELECT JSON_ARRAY(1,2,3), JSON_OBJECT(\"a\",61,\"b\",62)')\nfor r in cur:\n    print(r, \"\\n\")\n\ncur.close()\n\nc.close()\n```\n\nCapture:\n[mysql_84_ps_json.pcapng](/uploads/f6b0894c16b9f7bde9589bc9efab941d/mysql_84_ps_json.pcapng)\n\n![image](/uploads/0931c47bd07fe9cd248c629205dab862/image.png)\n\n![image](/uploads/22caec4a284d44e95b15b2fbd0cffad0/image.png)\n\n- https://dev.mysql.com/doc/dev/mysql-server/latest/page_protocol_binary_resultset.html",
